# V1 mobile port

Canonical rule: `docs/design/mapping/v1-mobile-port-recipe.md`.
Findings: `docs/design/mapping/v1-port-findings.md`.
V1 app is read-only at `E:\showzy\apps\mobile`.

- **Improve craft, not the product.** Bind hardcoded color/space/radius/type
  to the Unistyles theme (Class A). Snap off-scale values to existing tokens
  (Class B). Do not change IA, tabs, gestures, copy, or control hierarchy
  (Class C) — keep V1 and append a `proposed` finding.
- If the class is unclear, it is C.
- Read V1 `theme`, `components/ui`, glass/shell, and screen layout. Do not
  copy Supabase, Nest clients, `lib/actions`, or entity stores.
- V2 screens take contract view-models and callbacks. No `companyId` from
  input as an access grant. Chat stores IDs, not order state.
- Figma is not a source of tokens or components. AI overlay is out of scope
  until `vm-T29`.
- New npm dependencies need owner approval in the PR description.
